OL,3,GNEWSA#50k reward to find body of man
OL,4,Amissing for 10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #50,000 reward has been offered for
OL,7,Finformation leading to finding the body
OL,8,Fof a man who has been missing for more
OL,9,Fthan a decade.
OL,11,FMichael Martin, from Salford, was
OL,12,Freported missing on 8 August 2016 after
OL,13,Fthe then 25-year-old was last seen at a
OL,14,Fpetrol station on Bolton Road, in
OL,15,FKearsley, Bolton, the day before.
OL,17,FTen years on, detectives investigating
OL,18,Fhis murder have offered the reward to
OL,19,Ftry find his body.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
