OL,3,GNEWSA#50k reward to find body of man
OL,4,Amissing for 10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis father, Gregg Martin, said the
OL,7,F"not-knowing is gut wrenching every
OL,8,Fday" and added: "We know he's dead but
OL,9,Fit's just not knowing where he was,
OL,10,Fwhere he is and what happened to him.
OL,11,FIt'd give the family some closure ` a
OL,12,Fform of sort of peace."
